{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"db7bdb9f5ae22a0c","type":"text","text":"<center>LLM text watermarking</center>","x":-320,"y":-2320,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"aa61238200bd46b4","type":"text","text":"<center>Post-hoc watermarking</center>","x":-320,"y":-2600,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"1a78894eef4a8af4","type":"text","text":"<center>Weight-based watermarking</center>","x":280,"y":-2320,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"f561ecb41fe11924","type":"text","text":"<center>Logits-based</center>","x":-920,"y":-1880,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"49daf622d85a994b","type":"text","text":"[[论文 Scalable watermarking for identifying large language model outputs]]  \n**Nature'24** | SynthID  \n<span class=\"badge badge-cyan\">sampling-based</span> <span class=\"badge badge-blue\">distortion-free</span>  \nSynthID 算法提出了锦标赛采样，首次证明了大模型水印可以应用于商业大模型中","x":240,"y":-1760,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"1bb68e3d97355a9d","type":"text","text":"<center>Lexical-substitution-based</center>","x":280,"y":-2800,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"f51c46434853a613","type":"text","text":"<center>LLM-rewrite-based</center>","x":-920,"y":-2800,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"92d942c0eebb126c","type":"text","text":"[[论文 How Good is Post-Hoc Watermarking With Language Model Rephrasing]]  \n**ICML‘26**  \n<span class=\"badge badge-purple\">post-hoc</span>\n使用一个额外的 LLM 来对已有文本嵌入水印，即以 LLM rewrite 的形式利用了“原本被设计为在解码生成阶段使用的水印算法（如 KGW 等）”","x":-960,"y":-3200,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"a2e3f1af6279fe7b","type":"text","text":"<center>优化文本质量</center>","x":-920,"y":-1370,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"e44c108fca6e2ebf","type":"text","text":"<center>优化鲁棒性</center>","x":-80,"y":-1370,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"0ca7fb272f907bbe","type":"text","text":"<center>优化检测性</center>","x":-2220,"y":-1370,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"189ed0d846dc4b85","type":"text","text":"[[论文 Who wrote this code watermarking for code generation]]  \n**ACL‘24** | SWEET  \n<span class=\"badge badge-green\">logits-based</span>  \n引入熵阈值，仅对高熵位置进行水印嵌入/检测","x":-2560,"y":-1120,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"e855663f54510418","type":"text","text":"[[论文 SSG Logit-Balanced Vocabulary Partitioning for LLM Watermarking]]  \n**ACL‘26** | SSG  \n<span class=\"badge badge-green\">logits-based</span>  \n先按 logit 对 token 排序，再将高 logit token 两两分组、每组随机分配一个 green 和一个 red，从而保证 green/red 集合在高概率区域更平衡","x":-2100,"y":-1120,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"5d10df92e07cb21f","type":"text","text":"[[论文 Subtle Signatures, Strong Shields Advancing Robust and Imperceptible Watermarking in Large Language Models]]  \n**ACL‘24 Findings** | RIW  \n<span class=\"badge badge-green\">logits-based</span>  \n对绿表中的 token，进一步根据其在语料中的先验概率大小来相应调高/降低 logits","x":-960,"y":-1120,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"4214c72a8e12f4a9","type":"text","text":"[[论文 A watermark for large language models]]  \n**ICML‘23** | KGW  \n<span class=\"badge badge-green\">logits-based</span>  \nKGW 算法是大模型水印的开山之作，提出了 red/green list 范式，通过在每步生成时提高 greenlist 中 tokens 的 logits 来引入可检测的偏差。后续的许多方法基于此进行改进\n","x":-960,"y":-1760,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"3249861287972d5b","type":"text","text":"[[论文 On the learnability of watermarks for language models]]  \n**ICLR'24**  \n提出水印蒸馏，证明水印算法存在可学习性，可通过微调大模型使水印特征直接被嵌入模型权重，并生成可被检测器识别的文本","x":700,"y":-2392,"width":400,"height":205},
		{"id":"86268159d0209ff1","type":"text","text":"[[论文 DeepTextMark A Deep Learning-Driven Text Watermarking Approach for Identifying Large Language Model Generated Text]]  \n**IEEE Access‘23** | DeepTextMark  \n<span class=\"badge badge-purple\">post-hoc</span>  \n提出一种在文本生成后通过近义词替换插入隐蔽水印、再用深度学习检测水印的方案","x":240,"y":-3200,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"5252603a5644728a","type":"text","text":"[[论文 PostMark A Robust Blackbox Watermark for Large Language Models]]  \n**EMNLP‘24** | PostMark  \n<span class=\"badge badge-purple\">post-hoc</span>  \n对已有文本，先根据其语义嵌入从一个秘密词表中选出一组与语义相关的“水印词”，再调用一个单独的指令遵循 LLM，将这些词自然插入文本中","x":-520,"y":-3200,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"d37fc7adbebe5c5d","type":"text","text":"[[论文 Watermarking Text Generated by Black-Box Language Models]]    \n**arXiv'23** | WTGB  \n<span class=\"badge badge-purple\">post-hoc</span>  \n先利用“当前词 + 前一词”的哈希构造上下文相关的随机二值编码，使普通文本中 bit-0 与 bit-1 近似均衡；再通过 BERT 生成上下文同义词并结合语义相似度筛选，优先将表示 bit-0 的词替换为表示 bit-1 的高质量同义词，从而把整段文本的统计分布推向“带水印”状态","x":740,"y":-3200,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"49632ab757a618f6","type":"text","text":"[[论文 Post-Hoc Watermarking for Robust Detection in Text Generated by Large Language Models]]    \n**COLING‘25** | RSFPH  \n<span class=\"badge badge-purple\">post-hoc</span>  \n先通过命名实体识别和依存句法分析，挑选适合修改的水印锚点位置；再利用基于 paraphraser 的词汇替换，把这些位置上原本编码为 bit-0 的词尽量替换成语义一致、句法角色不变但编码为 bit-1 的词，从而使文本整体呈现可统计检测的 bit-1 偏置","x":740,"y":-3500,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"45b6c384465fa359","type":"text","text":"[[论文 Provable robust watermarking for ai-generated text]]  \n**ICLR‘24** | Unigram  \n<span class=\"badge badge-green\">logits-based</span>  \n将鲁棒性作为第一要义，证明了一个固定的全局红绿表划分更能抵抗水印移除攻击。代价是水印过于简单而敌手可能通过观察而猜到具体的水印规则","x":-120,"y":-1120,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"f06e0384b21f62b6","type":"text","text":"<center>Generation-time watermarking</center>","x":-320,"y":-2060,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"eb1c9ca1e77a2178","type":"text","text":"<center>Sampling-based</center>","x":900,"y":-1900,"width":320,"height":60},
		{"id":"412a93d591f81167","type":"text","text":"[[论文 SemStamp A Semantic Watermark with Paraphrastic Robustness for Text Generation]]  \n**NAACL'24** | SemStamp  \n<span class=\"badge badge-cyan\">sampling-based</span> <span class=\"badge badge-pink\">sentence-level</span>  \n基于 LSH 用超平面将语义空间划分为若干个固定的区域。生成时以句子为单位，根据上一个句子的 LSH 签名作为种子来将各区域标记为 valid/blocked，通过拒绝采样直到生成的句子落入 valid 区域","x":1340,"y":-1760,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"3e7d4bf03760f673","type":"text","text":"[[论文 k-SemStamp A Clustering-Based Semantic Watermark for Detection of Machine-Generated Text]]  \n**ACL'24 Findings** | k-SemStamp  \n<span class=\"badge badge-cyan\">sampling-based</span> <span class=\"badge badge-pink\">sentence-level</span>  \n相比 SemStamp 不使用 LSH 随机超平面划分语义空间，改为先在目标文本领域中用句子编码器提取句向量，再通过 k-Means 聚类按照语义结构划分嵌入空间。","x":1340,"y":-1440,"width":400,"height":200}
	],
